  "description": "QIVRIY crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3 c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C127 H192 Fe6 Gd6 O59 P6. From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 11 O neighbors; Fe1 (Fe) has 6 O neighbors; Gd1A (Gd) has 11 O neighbors; Fe1A (Fe) has 6 O neighbors; Gd1C (Gd) has 11 O neighbors; Fe1C (Fe) has 6 O neighbors; Gd1R (Gd) has 11 O neighbors; Fe1R (Fe) has 6 O neighbors; Gd1S (Gd) has 11 O neighbors; Fe1S (Fe) has 6 O neighbors; Gd1U (Gd) has 11 O neighbors; Fe1U (Fe) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 18 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.315-3.931 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 103.37-119.59°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Fe6Gd6(μ3-O)2(O3PPh)6(O2CtBu)18(CO3)]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
